---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About — Intelligence Snacks" description="Long conversations developed into useful ideas.">
  <header class="about-head page-shell"><p class="eyebrow">About the publication</p><h1>The podcast creates room for ideas to be explored. Intelligence Snacks serves the strongest ideas that emerge.</h1></header>
  <section class="about-copy page-shell section"><h2>Depth first.<br />Clarity after.</h2><div><p>Intelligence Snacks is a podcast, newsletter and connected archive about AI, software, business, work and technological change.</p><p>Each long-form conversation produces distinct, self-contained arguments. We develop those arguments into permanent pages, select the strongest for a weekly edition and connect them to the wider body of thinking.</p><p>Intelligence Snacks is produced by Other Stuff, an AI software company based in Perth.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .about-head { padding-block: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 10rem); }
  .about-head h1 { max-width: 1450px; font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 8.5rem); line-height: .87; letter-spacing: -.075em; font-weight: 510; }
  .about-copy { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr; gap: 8vw; }
  .about-copy h2 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6.5rem); line-height: .87; letter-spacing: -.075em; font-weight: 520; }
  .about-copy div { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 1.3rem; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .about-copy { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
